# Project Context & Instructions

## Project Overview
- **Project Name:** [Insert Project Name]
- **Purpose:** [Briefly describe what the application/repository does]
- **Primary Language(s) & Framework(s):** [e.g., Python, FastAPI, PostgreSQL]

## Architecture & Directory Structure
- `src/` - Core application source code
- `tests/` - Unit and integration test suites
- `docs/` - Architecture notes and API documentation

## Coding Standards & Conventions
- **Style:** Follow existing formatting, naming conventions, and linter rules.
- **Modularity:** Write small, single-responsibility functions.
- **Types & Documentation:** Include explicit type annotations and concise docstrings.

## Safety Rules
- **Verify First:** Always read relevant files (using @filename) before proposing edits.
- **Scope:** Keep changes focused strictly on the requested task.
